      "body": "- State the extraction requirement on the rendered code markers; in RFCXML this is produced by sourcecode name + markers=\"true\".\n- Move RFC 7991 to Informative (removes the normative downref flagged by idnits) and add the RFCXML vocabulary reference, which is where the markers attribute is defined.\n- New section \"Updates to RFC 9907\" with OLD/NEW text for RFC 9907 Section 3.12.\n- Abstract and Introduction now state what the update changes and point to the new section.",
